FINAL OPERATING INSTRUCTION

Start by inspecting the real repository and discovering the actual application architecture.

Then build the complete route inventory and test matrix. Audit the frontend, routing, redirects, APIs, database, authentication, property pipeline, enrichment, AI description rewriting, approval, publishing, and deployment.

Fix confirmed defects, add regression coverage, run the appropriate tests, and verify the production build.

Do not stop after the homepage. Do not stop after the build. Do not stop after listing problems. Do not assume merged code is live. Do not assume a visible button works. Do not assume a successful request means the entire workflow works.

Follow every important operation through the entire system until its actual result is visible and correctly persisted.

Use the current codebase as the source of truth. Preserve working functionality, protect existing data, and avoid unapproved destructive operations.

The goal is a functioning, consistent, secure, maintainable, and verifiably integrated Choice real-estate platform—not merely code that compiles.